OL,3,GOrkney & Shetland
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FCloudy with showers in the
OL,6,Fmorning which may be heavy at times.
OL,7,FRemaining cloudy with longer spells of
OL,8,Fheavy rain through the afternoon.
OL,9,FFresh to strong southeasterly winds.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FCloudy start with outbreaks
OL,12,Fof rain but becoming drier for a time
OL,13,Flater in the evening. Overnight
OL,14,Fremaining cloudy with some light rain
OL,15,Fpossible. Fresh to strong winds easing.
OL,16,
OL,17,CThursday:FCloudy in the morning with
OL,18,Flight rain in Orkney, but heavy
OL,19,Fpersistent rain in Shetland. Rain
OL,20,Fclears to the north leaving bright
OL,21,Fspells and showers for all.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
