OL,3,GOrkney & Shetland
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Friday to Sunday:FMostly
OL,6,Fcloudy with showers Friday, then
OL,7,Fheavier rain spreads north later. Dry
OL,8,Fearly Saturday before heavy rain
OL,9,Freturns. Sunday remains cloudy with
OL,10,Frain or showers. Becoming windy, with
OL,11,Fgales developing.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
